{"id":13217,"slug":"municipalidad-de-maullin-presente-en-sesion-de-la-crubc-los-lagos","title":"MUNICIPALIDAD DE MAULLÍN PRESENTE EN SESIÓN DE LA CRUBC LOS LAGOS","date":"2026-08-25T14:55:45","excerpt":"El alcalde de Maullín, Nabih Soza, participa esta jornada en Puerto Montt en la 2ª Sesión Ordinaria 2026 de la Comisión Regional de Uso del Borde Costero (CRUBC) de Los Lagos. Durante la sesión se analizan y someten a pronunciamiento distintas materias relacionadas con el uso y desarrollo del borde costero regional, entre ellas: Solicitudes […]","categories":[{"id":179,"name":"Agrupaciones Comunitarias","slug":"agrupaciones-comunitarias"},{"id":10,"name":"Cultura/Comunidad","slug":"cultura-comunidad"},{"id":370,"name":"Desarrollo social y comunitario","slug":"desarrollo-social-y-comunitario"},{"id":11,"name":"Fomento","slug":"fomento"},{"id":33,"name":"Innovación","slug":"innovacion"},{"id":1,"name":"Proyectos","slug":"proyectos"},{"id":34,"name":"Regional","slug":"regional"},{"id":32,"name":"Seguridad","slug":"seguridad"},{"id":15,"name":"Turismo","slug":"turismo"}],"author":"Redacción Último Bastión","image":"/images/posts/13217.webp","content":"<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">El alcalde de Maullín, Nabih Soza, participa esta jornada en Puerto Montt en la 2ª Sesión Ordinaria 2026 de la Comisión Regional de Uso del Borde Costero (CRUBC) de Los Lagos.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durante la sesión se analizan y someten a pronunciamiento distintas materias relacionadas con el uso y desarrollo del borde costero regional, entre ellas:</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🔹\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf3/1/16/1f539.png\"/> Solicitudes de Espacios Costeros Marinos de Pueblos Originarios (ECMPO) en Isla Tranqui, Tabón y Puluqui, Nercón y Yaldad.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🔹\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf3/1/16/1f539.png\"/> Solicitudes de concesiones marítimas en sectores de Puerto Montt, Hualaihué, Quellón y Ancud.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🔹\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf3/1/16/1f539.png\"/> Reconocimiento de nuevas caletas pesqueras, entre ellas Metri, Yerbas Buenas y Chaiguao.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La instancia permite abordar estas materias desde una mirada regional, considerando las necesidades de las comunidades, el desarrollo de las actividades productivas y la adecuada gestión del borde costero de la Región de Los Lagos.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13224\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-02-1024x682.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-02-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-02-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-02-767x511.jpg 767w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-02.jpg 1181w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-108 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13222\" data-id=\"13222\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-03-1024x682.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-03-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-03-767x511.jpg 767w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-03-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-03.jpg 1181w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13221\" data-id=\"13221\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-04-1024x682.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-04-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-04-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-04-767x511.jpg 767w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-04.jpg 1181w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13223\" data-id=\"13223\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-05-1024x682.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-05-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-05-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-05-767x511.jpg 767w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/crub-05.jpg 1181w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-im